msgctxt "476_Employee"
msgid "Welcome. Let me show you to your seats."
msgstr "Bienvenidos. Permítame mostrarles sus asientos."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "488_Employee"
msgid "Right this way, please."
msgstr "Por aquí, por favor."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "548_Akiyama"
msgid "First, let's go over the basics of how to interact with a\\r\ncustomer on a date."
msgstr "Primero, vamos a repasar los conceptos básicos de como interactuar con un cliente en una cita."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "560_Miki"
msgid "I'm listening."
msgstr "Te escucho."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "572_Akiyama"
msgid "(How <Italic>do</Italic> you interact with a customer on a date...?)"
msgstr "(¿Cómo debería actuar con un cliente en un cita...?)"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "584_Akiyama"
msgid "You've got to act exactly the same, whether you're at the\\r\nclub or on a date."
msgstr "Tienes que actuar de la misma forma que cuando estás en el club."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "596_Miki"
msgid "Really? Why?"
msgstr "¿En serio? ¿Por qué?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "608_Akiyama"
msgid "It would confuse the guy if you started acting differently\\r\njust because you weren't at work."
msgstr "Si cambias tu forma de tratarlo estando fuera del local, seguramente el cliente terminaría muy confundido."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "620_Miki"
msgid "But wouldn't that make the whole \"going on a date\" thing\\r\nseem kind of pointless?"
msgstr "Eh... ¿Entonces, cuál es el punto de salir en una cita? Parece un despropósito."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "632_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh, I hadn't thought of that..."
msgstr "Es verdad..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "644_Miki"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "656_Akiyama"
msgid "I was just kidding. Actually..."
msgstr "Estaba bromeando, ja, ja. En realidad..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "668_Akiyama"
msgid "You need to be more guarded when you're out on a date with a\\r\ncustomer."
msgstr "Cuando sales con un cliente, tienes que ser muy cautelosa y atenta."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "680_Miki"
msgid "More guarded?"
msgstr "¿Más cautelosa?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "692_Akiyama"
msgid "That's right. You don't want him to think he can get away\\r\nwith something just because you're not at work."
msgstr "Así es. No tienes que dejar que él piense que puede salirse con la suya como si nada, solo porque no está en el club."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "704_Miki"
msgid "But won't it make him feel uncomfortable if I'm on the\\r\ndefensive all the time? I mean, after he asked me out and\\r\neverything...?"
msgstr "¿Pero si estoy a la defensiva todo el tiempo, no quedaré mal? Después de todo, se tomó la molestia de invitarme..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "716_Akiyama"
msgid "Right..."
msgstr "Cierto..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "728_Miki"
msgid "And if I'm not careful, he might even stop asking for me at\\r\nthe club, too..."
msgstr "Además, si no tengo cuidado, incluso puede que deje de solicitarme en el club..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "740_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh, well, that was just a little joke. In fact, you've gotta..."
msgstr "Es que eso en realidad era una bromita. Lo que de verdad, debes hacer es..."

