msgstr "Estaba bromeando, ja, ja. En realidad..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "920_Akiyama"
msgid "You should be more open and honest with a customer when\\r\nyou're on a date with him."
msgstr "Cuando tienes una cita con un cliente, tienes que ser más abierta y honesta."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "932_Miki"
msgid "Open and honest?"
msgstr "¿Abierta y honesta?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "944_Akiyama"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr "Así es."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "956_Akiyama"
msgid "Why do you think guys ask hostesses out on dates, anyway?"
msgstr "¿Por qué crees que los clientes les piden a las hostesses salir con ellos luego del trabajo?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "968_Miki"
msgid "I'd say they want to get to know us better."
msgstr "Supongo que quieren conocernos mejor."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "980_Akiyama"
msgid "Exactly. They want to get closer to you so they can stand\\r\nout among all your other clients."
msgstr "Exacto. Ellos quieren acercarse para poder ser un cliente especial. Uno que destaque de los demás."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "992_Akiyama"
msgid "That's why you should be a little more open on a date than\\r\nyou are at the club."
msgstr "Es por eso que tienes que hablarles de forma más informal que en el club. Tienes que estar relajada, ser tú misma."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1004_Miki"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr "Bueno..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1016_Akiyama"
msgid "He'll think he's the only one who gets to see who you really\\r\nare, which, he'll figure, makes him somebody pretty special."
msgstr "Con eso, los clientes pensarán que son los únicos a los que les muestras tu verdadera cara y erróneamente pensarán que son especiales para ti."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1028_Miki"
msgid "I get it now!"
msgstr "¡Ya entiendo!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1040_Akiyama"
msgid "Basically, interacting with the customer differently will make him see your date as more than just business."
msgstr "Básicamente, si interactúas con un cliente de manera diferente, la cita no lucirá como parte de un negocio."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1052_Akiyama"
msgid "It'll be something personal, an experience for him and him alone."
msgstr "Será algo más personal, una experiencia privada con él y para nadie más."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1064_Miki"
msgid "Right!"
msgstr "¡Es verdad!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1124_Master"
msgid "So what'll it be?"
msgstr "¿Qué les gustaría pedir?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1136_Akiyama"
msgid "Let's see..."
msgstr "Veamos..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1148_Miki"
msgid "Okay, I'll have..."
msgstr "Bueno, yo voy a querer..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1160_Akiyama"
msgid "Not so fast. There's a little trick when it comes to\\r\nordering, too."
msgstr "Espera un momento. También hay un truco que debes tener en cuenta al hacer un pedido."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1172_Miki"
msgid "There is?"
msgstr "¿Lo hay?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1184_Akiyama"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr "Por supuesto."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1196_Akiyama"
msgid "(When it comes time to order...)"
msgstr "(Cuando llega el momento de ordenar...)."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1208_Akiyama"
msgid "When you go out to eat on a date, always order your favorite\\r\ndish."
msgstr "Cuando estés en una cita, siempre debes pedir tu comida favorita."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1220_Miki"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "¿De verdad?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1232_Akiyama"
msgid "Yep. Hostesses order what they like. It's a fundamental\\r\nrule."
msgstr "Sí. Las hostesses siempre piden lo que a ellas les gusta. Es una regla esencial."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1244_Miki"
msgid "I don't imagine the guy would mind too much, but I don't see\\r\nhow it could have much of a positive effect on the evening,\\r\neither..."
msgstr "Me imagino que a la otra persona no le importaría demasiado, pero tampoco diría que es algo positivo..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "1256_Akiyama"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "1268_Miki"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1280_Akiyama"
msgid "I'm glad you caught that. Actually..."
msgstr "Así que te diste cuenta. En realidad..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1292_Akiyama"
msgid "When you go out to eat on a date, it's important to order\\r\nyour date's favorite dish."
msgstr "Cuando estés en una cita, es importante que pidas la comida favorita de tu acompañante."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1304_Miki"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "¿De verdad?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1316_Akiyama"
msgid "When you see him at the club, get him to tell you his\\r\nfavorite in advance. Make sure you remember what it is."
msgstr "Cuando se vean en el club, asegúrate de averiguar su comida favorita. Memorízala bien."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1328_Akiyama"
msgid "Then, when you're on your date, try to order it in a very\\r\nmatter-of-fact way: \"Oh, your favorite is such-and-such,\\r\nisn't it?\""
msgstr "Así, cuando estén en la cita y pidas el plato de forma natural, dirás algo como: \"Ay, ¿este es tu plato favorito, verdad?\""

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1340_Akiyama"
msgid "That will make him think, \"Gee, Miki bothered to remember my\\r\nfavorite!\" And then he'll feel like you two have bonded."
msgstr "Eso le hará pensar: \"¡Ohh, Miki-chan recuerda lo que me gusta!\" Y con eso empezará a sentir que entre ustedes hay una conexión especial."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1352_Miki"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr "Bien..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1364_Akiyama"
msgid "But the real key here is to add, \"I like that, too,\" while\\r\nyou order."
msgstr "Pero lo más importante y la clave de todo esto es decirle: \"Es que a mí también me encanta, ji, ji, ji\". Y eso, mientras haces el pedido."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1376_Miki"
msgid "Why's that?"
msgstr "¿Por qué?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1388_Akiyama"
msgid "Well, for one thing, when your date says she likes the same\\r\nfood you do, it makes you happy. It also means you have\\r\nsimilar interests."
msgstr "Bueno, si tu cita te dice que le gusta lo mismo que a ti, simplemente te hace feliz. Significa también que ambos tienen gustos similares."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1400_Miki"
msgid "Oh, I get it. But what if his favorite happens to be\\r\nsomething I absolutely hate?"
msgstr "Ah, ya entiendo. ¿Pero qué pasa si su comida favorita es algo que odio completamente? ¿Qué hago en esa situación?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1412_Miki"
msgid "I can be a very picky person."
msgstr "Es que yo soy bastante quisquillosa con la comida."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1424_Akiyama"
msgid "You're a professional. Just grin and bear it."
msgstr "Eres una profesional. Tienes que aguantar y fingir que te encanta."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1436_Miki"
msgid "Aw, do I have to? I guess I'll try..."
msgstr "¿De verdad tengo que hacerlo? Haré mi mejor esfuerzo..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1460_Master"
msgid "Here you go!"
msgstr "¡Aquí tiene!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1508_Miki"
msgid "This looks amazing! Bon appétit!"
msgstr "¡Se ve delicioso! ¡Buen provecho!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1520_Akiyama"
msgid "Not so fast! There's another technique that comes into play\\r\nwhen eating your meal."
msgstr "¡No tan rápido! También hay otra técnica que puedes aplicar mientras estás comiendo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1532_Miki"
msgid "Is there really? Tell me about it."
msgstr "¿De verdad? A ver, dime."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1544_Akiyama"
msgid "(The thing to remember when eating is...)"
msgstr "(Lo que debes hacer mientras estés comiendo es...)."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1556_Akiyama"
msgid "When eating your meal on a date, you have to eat with\\r\nelegance and grace so as not to ruin your image as a\\r\nhostess."
msgstr "Cuando estés comiendo en una cita, tienes que hacerlo con elegancia y delicadeza, así mantienes tu imagen de hostess."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1568_Miki"
msgid "Why's that?"
msgstr "¿Por qué?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1580_Akiyama"
msgid "The customer no doubt has a mental picture of the hostess he\\r\nlikes. Ruin that image, and he's in for a rude awakening."
msgstr "El cliente ya tiene una imagen mental de su hostess favorita. Arruinarle esa imagen le daría una terrible desilusión."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1592_Akiyama"
msgid "You're at your most vulnerable while eating, making meals\\r\nparticularly dangerous."
msgstr "Cuando uno come, se encuentra muy vulnerable, así que ese momento es particularmente peligroso."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1604_Miki"
msgid "But if that's true, there's not much point in eating\\r\ntogether, is there?"
msgstr "Pero en ese caso, no tendría mucho sentido comer juntos."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1616_Miki"
msgid "I mean, it doesn't exactly flow with what you said before\\r\nabout projecting a sense of intimacy..."
msgstr "Solo digo que contradice la idea que mencionaste antes, eso de proyectar un ambiente exclusivo y privado..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1628_Akiyama"
msgid "You sure are sharp. I knew I could count on you to notice\\r\nthat. Well done. No, the real key here is..."
msgstr "...Qué atenta que estás, Miki. Así que te diste cuenta de mi prueba, ja, ja, ja. Bien hecho. La verdadera clave aquí es..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1640_Akiyama"
msgid "When dining with a date, you have to maintain proper\\r\netiquette while, at the same time, creating a domestic\\r\natmosphere."
msgstr "Cuando estés comiendo en una comida con el cliente, tienes que mantener una etiqueta apropiada y, al mismo tiempo, crear una atmósfera hogareña."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1652_Miki"
msgid "Domestic? Really?"
msgstr "¿Una atmósfera hogareña?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1664_Akiyama"
msgid "That's right. A hostess is typically seen as the polar\\r\nopposite of a domestic type."
msgstr "Sí, sí. A las hostesses se las suele considerar el polo opuesto de una persona hogareña."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1676_Akiyama"
msgid "So by projecting this homey aura, you accentuate the gap\\r\nbetween the two lifestyles."
msgstr "Entonces, al proyectarles esa atmósfera íntima, acentúas el contraste en tus dos formas de actuar."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1688_Akiyama"
msgid "A hostess who might seem a little distant at the club comes\\r\nacross on a date as friendlier, more accessible."
msgstr "Una chica que en el club se mostraba distante, pero que en una cita es mucho más cercana y amigable."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1700_Miki"
msgid "It's like you said before－you have to project a sense of\\r\nintimacy."
msgstr "En resumen, ¿se trata de crear una atmósfera familiar e íntima? Algo como el hogar."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1712_Akiyama"
msgid "Exactly."
msgstr "Eso es, ya lo tienes."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1724_Miki"
msgid "So how do I do that?"
msgstr "Pero ¿qué debo hacer exactamente para lograr eso?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1736_Akiyama"
msgid "Let's see. If a dish uses seasonal ingredients, for example,\\r\npoint that out to your date."
msgstr "Veamos. Si un plato utiliza ingredientes de temporada, entonces podrías decir: \"Estos de acá están riquísimos, ¿verdad?\""

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1748_Akiyama"
msgid "Or if a meal is nicely presented, say you'd like to try\\r\nmaking it yourself one day. Play up the fact that you can\\r\ncook."
msgstr "Por otro lado, si una comida está bien presentada, di que algún día vas a presentar tu comida así. Con ello presumirás que sabes cocinar."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1760_Akiyama"
msgid "You'd be hard-pressed to find a guy who doesn't love that."
msgstr "Estoy seguro que todos los hombres somos débiles a las mujeres que saben cocinar."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1772_Miki"
msgid "Hmm. Anything else?"
msgstr "Ya veo, ya veo. ¿Alguna cosa más?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1784_Akiyama"
msgid "When your date says something's tasty or what have you, say\\r\nsomething along the lines of, \"Oh, I'll keep that in mind.\""
msgstr "Cuando esa persona diga: \"Está delicioso\" o algo similar, di algo como: \"Así que te gusta eso, lo tomaré en cuenta, ji, ji\"."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1796_Miki"
msgid "It's almost like saying, \"I'll make that for you sometime,\"\\r\nright?"
msgstr "Es como si le dijeras, \"La próxima vez te lo haré yo\", ¿verdad?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1808_Akiyama"
msgid "Yep. It's just the promise of your cooking, though. You\\r\ndon't actually have to go through with it. You only need to\\r\nhint at the possibility."
msgstr "Sí, pero es solo para que sepa que sabes cocinar. No hace falta que lo hagas ni que sea verdad. Basta con que le dejes ver la posibilidad."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1820_Miki"
msgid "Right, right. This has been very educational."
msgstr "Vaya, estoy aprendiendo mucho con esto."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1880_Akiyama"
msgid "Thanks for a great meal, Chef. We'll take the bill now."
msgstr "Gracias por la comida, Maestro. Por favor, quisiera la cuenta."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1892_Master"
msgid "Coming right up!"
msgstr "¡Enseguida!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1964_Akiyama"
msgid "Now, there's one more thing I'd like you to remember when it\\r\ncomes to paying the bill."
msgstr "Ahora, hay una última cosa que me gustaría que recordaras para cuando llegue el momento de pagar la cuenta."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1976_Miki"
msgid "Okay."
msgstr "A ver."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "1988_Akiyama"
msgid "(The trick about paying the bill is...)"
msgstr "(El truco al momento de pagar es...)."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "2000_Akiyama"
msgid "When you've been asked out on a date, you should go Dutch.\\r\nEach of you pays his or her share."
msgstr "Cuando te inviten a una cita, recuerda dividir la cuenta."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "2012_Miki"
msgid "Are you serious!?"
msgstr "¡¿Seguro que está bien dividirla?!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "2024_Akiyama"
msgid "I sure am. It shows your gratitude for your date's regular\\r\nvisits to the club."
msgstr "Sip. Demostrarías que estás agradecida por las visitas frecuentes que te hace en el club."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "2036_Miki"
msgid "It might boost my image, but isn't it a little much\\r\nconsidering he's the one who asked me out?"
msgstr "Eso podría mejorar mi imagen, pero... ¿no es un poco injusto dividir la cuenta cuando fue él quien me invitó?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "2048_Akiyama"
msgid "Ah..."
msgstr "Cierto..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "2060_Miki"
msgid "Besides, I'd be afraid of hurting his pride..."
msgstr "Además, tengo miedo de herir su orgullo..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "2072_Akiyama"
msgid "Good call, Miki. That's one thing you never want to do, hurt\\r\na customer's pride."
msgstr "Muy bien, Miki. Eso es algo que nunca debes hacer, herir el orgullo de un cliente."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "2084_Miki"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "2096_Akiyama"
msgid "Instead..."
msgstr "En vez de eso..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "2108_Akiyama"
msgid "When dinner's over and the bill arrives, always take out\\r\nyour wallet and act like you're going to pay."
msgstr "Cuando llegue la cuenta, saca tu cartera como si estuvieras preparada para pagar todo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "2120_Miki"
msgid "You want me to put on an act?"
msgstr "¿Tengo que fingir?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "2132_Akiyama"
msgid "That's right. You're just pretending."
msgstr "Así es. Solo estarás fingiendo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "2144_Akiyama"
msgid "Seeing you prepared to pay like that transforms the evening\\r\nfrom a customer/hostess interaction to a much more private,\\r\nintimate meal."
msgstr "Cuando él te vea preparada para pagar transformarás la cita entre cliente y hostess a una interacción más privada e íntima."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "2156_Akiyama"
msgid "Your date will feel an even closer bond between the two of\\r\nyou. Plus, he'll be impressed by your manners."
msgstr "Tu cliente sentirá que ambos son más cercanos. Además, se impresionará con tus buenos modales y te tendrá en un pedestal."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "2168_Miki"
msgid "Ah, I see."
msgstr "Oh, ya veo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "2180_Akiyama"
msgid "Your date will insist you don't have to pay, of course, at\\r\nwhich point you thank him and put your wallet away."
msgstr "Por supuesto que la otra persona insistirá en que no tienes que pagar. En este punto, le agradecerás y guardarás tu cartera."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "2192_Akiyama"
msgid "This way, you're both satisfied, and he keeps his pride\\r\nintact."
msgstr "Y así, ambos quedan satisfechos y él mantendrá su orgullo intacto."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "2204_Miki"
msgid "Got it."
msgstr "Entiendo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "2216_Akiyama"
msgid "Dates provide another setting for building a relationship\\r\nformed at the club."
msgstr "Las citas te darán un escenario extra para darle un empujón más a la relación que tienes con los clientes."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "2228_Akiyama"
msgid "Make the most of the situation of meeting outside the club,\\r\nand you can project a sense of intimacy you can't create at\\r\nwork."
msgstr "Debes aprovechar al máximo estas situaciones fuera del club para proyectarles un ambiente más íntimo, algo que dentro del club no puedes hacer."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "2240_Akiyama"
msgid "Your customer will feel close to you, and he'll come to like\\r\nyou more and more."
msgstr "El cliente se sentirá más cercano a ti y le gustarás cada vez más y más."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "2252_Miki"
msgid "This has all been so helpful. I'll give it all a try, then."
msgstr "Aprendí mucho hoy. ¡Haré mi mejor esfuerzo!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "2276_Employee"
msgid "Act exactly like you do at the club."
msgstr "Actúa exactamente igual que en el club"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "2288_Employee"
msgid "Be more guarded."
msgstr "Sé más cautelosa"

